#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:2
msgid "Collaborate within Microsoft Teams"
msgstr "Microsoft Teams 내에서 협업"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/entry-ent.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Enterprise, and Enterprise "
"Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ (not available on "
"Professional)"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜 "
"<https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용 가능(Professional에서는 사용 "
"불가)"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Mattermost for Microsoft Teams integration enables you to break "
"through siloes in a mixed Mattermost and Teams environment by forwarding "
"real-time chat notifications from Teams to Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost for Microsoft Teams 통합을 사용하면 Teams의 실시간 채팅 알림을 "
"OKR.BEST로 전달하여 OKR.BEST와 Teams가 혼합된 환경에서 사일로를 허물 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:9
msgid ""
"Mattermost for Microsoft Teams integration forwards real-time chat "
"notifications from Teams to Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost for Microsoft Teams 통합은 Teams의 실시간 채팅 알림을 OKR.BEST로 "
"전달합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:17
msgid "Connect your Mattermost account to your Microsoft Teams account"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 계정을 Microsoft Teams 계정에 연결"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:20
msgid ""
"Your System Administrator must install and enable the :doc:`Mattermost "
"for Microsoft Teams integration </integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-"
"sync>` and ensure :ref:`support for notifications is enabled "
"<administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings:sync "
"notifications>` in order for you to connect your account and recieve chat"
" notifications."
msgstr ""
"계정을 연결하고 채팅 알림을 받으려면 시스템 관리자가 :doc:`Mattermost for "
"Microsoft Teams 통합 </integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-sync>`\\ 을 설치하고 "
"활성화하며 :ref:`알림 지원이 활성화되어 <administration-guide/configure/plugins-"
"configuration-settings:sync notifications>` 있는지 확인해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:22
msgid ""
"Once the integration is installed and configured by a System "
"Administrator, you can connect your Mattermost user account to your "
"Microsoft Teams account. You only need to complete this step once."
msgstr ""
"시스템 관리자가 통합을 설치하고 구성하면, OKR.BEST 사용자 계정을 Microsoft Teams "
"계정에 연결할 수 있습니다. 이 단계는 한 번만 완료하면 됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:24
msgid "Log into Mattermost using your credentials."
msgstr "자격 증명을 사용하여 OKR.BEST에 로그인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:25
msgid ""
"In any channel, run the ``/msteams connect`` slash command, and select "
"the resulting link."
msgstr ""
"아무 채널에서 ``/msteams connect`` 슬래시 명령을 실행하고, 결과로 표시되는 링크를 "
"선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:26
msgid ""
"Authenticate with Microsoft Teams using the email address matching your "
"account in Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST의 계정과 일치하는 이메일 주소를 사용하여 Microsoft Teams로 인증하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:28
msgid "Mattermost will confirm when your account is connected."
msgstr "계정이 연결되면 OKR.BEST가 확인해 줍니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:30
msgid ""
"Once you've connected your Mattermost account to your Microsoft Teams "
"account, when you're offline or away from Microsoft Teams, any messages "
"you receive in a chat or group chat in Microsoft Teams will display in "
"Mattermost as a notification and include a link to open the chat in "
"Microsoft Teams to continue the conversation. These notifications won't "
"appear if you've been recently active in Teams."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 계정을 Microsoft Teams 계정에 연결하면, Microsoft Teams에서 "
"오프라인이거나 자리를 비운 동안 Microsoft Teams의 채팅이나 그룹 채팅에서 받는 모든 "
"메시지가 OKR.BEST에 알림으로 표시되며, 대화를 계속하기 위해 Microsoft Teams에서 "
"채팅을 열 수 있는 링크가 포함됩니다. 최근에 Teams에서 활동한 경우 이러한 알림은 "
"표시되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:32
msgid "An example of a chat message notification."
msgstr "채팅 메시지 알림의 예입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:36
msgid "Manage notification settings"
msgstr "알림 설정 관리"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:38
msgid ""
"Manage your Mattermost notification settings for the Microsoft Teams "
"integration at any time in **Settings** > **Plugin Preferences**"
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Teams 통합에 대한 OKR.BEST 알림 설정은 언제든지 **설정** > **플러그인 "
"환경 설정**\\ 에서 관리할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:40
msgid ""
"Manage notification settings for the Microsoft Teams integration in "
"Account Settings > Plugin Preferences"
msgstr ""
"계정 설정 > 플러그인 환경 설정에서 Microsoft Teams 통합에 대한 알림 설정을 "
"관리하세요"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:45
msgid ""
"You can run the following :ref:`slash commands <integrations-guide/run-"
"slash-commands:run slash commands>` to manage your integration settings "
"by typing the commands into the Mattermost message text box, and "
"selecting **Send**:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 메시지 텍스트 상자에 명령을 입력하고 **보내기**\\ 를 선택하여 다음 "
":ref:`슬래시 명령 <integrations-guide/run-slash-commands:run slash "
"commands>`\\ 을 실행하여 통합 설정을 관리할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:47
msgid ""
"``/msteams connect``: Connect your Mattermost account to Microsoft Teams "
"account."
msgstr ""
"``/msteams connect``: OKR.BEST 계정을 Microsoft Teams 계정에 연결합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:48
msgid ""
"``/msteams disconnect``: Disconnect your Mattermost account from "
"Microsoft Teams account."
msgstr ""
"``/msteams disconnect``: OKR.BEST 계정을 Microsoft Teams 계정에서 연결 "
"해제합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:49
msgid "``/msteams status``: Show your current connection status."
msgstr "``/msteams status``: 현재 연결 상태를 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:50
msgid ""
"``/msteams notifications on|off``: Change your current notifications "
"settings."
msgstr "``/msteams notifications on|off``: 현재 알림 설정을 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:53
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:56
msgid "How does the integration determine when to send chat notifications?"
msgstr "통합은 채팅 알림을 보낼 시점을 어떻게 결정하나요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:58
msgid ""
"Chat notifications are sent in real-time whenever you're not active in "
"Microsoft Teams and receive a chat or group chat. Mattermost uses your "
"online status in Teams to determine if a chat notification should be "
"delivered. Mattermost delivers notifications if you appear **Away** or "
"**Offline** in Microsoft Teams, so the default behavior for when "
"notifications will be delivered depends on the client you typically use "
"to access Microsoft Teams:"
msgstr ""
"채팅 알림은 Microsoft Teams에서 활동하지 않는 동안 채팅이나 그룹 채팅을 받을 "
"때마다 실시간으로 전송됩니다. OKR.BEST는 Teams의 온라인 상태를 사용하여 채팅 "
"알림을 전달해야 하는지 결정합니다. OKR.BEST는 Microsoft Teams에서 **자리 비움** "
"또는 **오프라인**\\ 으로 표시되는 경우 알림을 전달하므로, 알림이 전달되는 시점에 "
"대한 기본 동작은 일반적으로 Microsoft Teams에 액세스하는 데 사용하는 클라이언트에 "
"따라 달라집니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:60
msgid ""
"Web browser: Mattermost delivers notifications when you've not had "
"activity in your Microsoft Teams browser tab for 5 minutes or more, when "
"the browser tab is closed, or when you mark yourself as **Offline** in "
"Microsoft Teams."
msgstr ""
"웹 브라우저: OKR.BEST는 Microsoft Teams 브라우저 탭에서 5분 이상 활동이 없거나, "
"브라우저 탭이 닫혀 있거나, Microsoft Teams에서 자신을 **오프라인**\\ 으로 표시한 "
"경우 알림을 전달합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:61
msgid ""
"Desktop app: Mattermost delivers notifications when you've not had "
"activity at your computer for 5 minutes or more, when the Microsoft Teams"
" desktop app is closed, or when you mark yourself as **Offline** in "
"Microsoft Teams."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱: OKR.BEST는 컴퓨터에서 5분 이상 활동이 없거나, Microsoft Teams "
"데스크톱 앱이 닫혀 있거나, Microsoft Teams에서 자신을 **오프라인**\\ 으로 표시한 "
"경우 알림을 전달합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:63
msgid ""
"In order to avoid double notifications, Mattermost won't deliver chat "
"notifications when your availability is set to **Available**, **Busy**, "
"**Do not disturb**, or **Be right back** in Microsoft Teams."
msgstr ""
"중복 알림을 피하기 위해, OKR.BEST는 Microsoft Teams에서 가용성이 **온라인**, "
"**다른 용무 중**, **방해 금지**, 또는 **곧 돌아옴**\\ 으로 설정된 경우 채팅 "
"알림을 전달하지 않습니다."

